    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "de Courcy Estate Agents are delighted to offer for sale No 13  Vereker Gardens located in a mature and well-established cul de sac development situated only a 5-minute walk to the city centre and adjacent to the award winning 4-star Strand Hotel. Both TUS Gaa Grounds and Thomond Park Rugby Stadium are an easy walk and with endless host of amenities given the close proximity to Limerick City Centre.\r\nViewing highly recommended"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION: \r\n\r\nAluminium sliding door: \r\n\r\nEntrance hall:  Tiled floor. Closet under stairs\r\n\r\nLarge sitting room:  7.5 m. x 3.4 m.  Feature marble fireplace. Timber floor (on top of concrete floor with insulation underneath)\r\n\r\nConservatory: 3.1 m. x 3.1 m. Tiled floor. Double doors to back garden.  \r\n\r\nDining area:  (old kitchen) 3.2 m. x 2.7 m  .Tiled floor.  Old pantry under stairs. \r\n\r\nKitchen: 3.1 m. x 2.7 m.   Fully fitted kitchen with granite work top.  Presses, drawers and eye level presses.  Including double oven, dishwasher, 4 ring hob, extractor and fridge freezer. \r\n\r\nUtility room:  Including washing machine and dryer. Work top, presses and eye level presses.  Gas boiler.\r\n\r\nShower/Toiler: Fully tiled.\r\n\r\nDownstairs bedroom 1: 4 m. x 2.8 m.  Double built in wardrobes.  Timber floor (Concrete under timber with insulation)\r\n\r\nUPSTAIRS:\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:  4.3 m.  x 3.2 m.   2  x double built in wardrobes.  \r\nBath/Toilet ensuite: Fully tiled.  Wash-hand-basin with presses underneath\r\n\r\nBedroom 3:  3.3 m. x 3.2 m.  Built in wardrobes.  \r\n\r\nShower/Toilet:  Wash-hand-basin – presses underneath.  Fully tiled.\r\n\r\nHot press:\t\r\n\r\nWINDOWS:        PVC double glazed windows - 2011.\r\n\r\nHEATING:          Gas fired central heating (New system installed in 2011)\r\n\r\nFLOOR AREA:    138.63 sq.mtrs (1,492 sq.ft)\r\n\r\nWIRING:             Rewired in 2011\r\n\r\nAGE:                   Built early 1960’s and extended 2011\r\n\r\nEXTENSIVE WORKS (2011) INCLUDE:\r\n•\tWalls pumped with insulation \r\n•\tInternal wall drylined. \r\n•\tAttic insulated. \r\n•\tGround floor insulation under floors\r\n•\tPVC d.g windows\r\n•\tNew gas fire heating system\r\n•\tReplumbed and new radiators \r\n•\tRewired\r\n•\tLiquid Solar panels on roof\r\n•\tBathroom ware and tiling’s\r\n•\tFitted kitchen\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE:  \r\nDrive in front entrance. Walled in rear. \r\nPaved area to rear. South facing back. \r\n\r\nINCLUDED: All appliances and contents also carpets, \r\ncurtains, blinds and light fittings\r\n\r\nVIEWING:  By appointment with Estate Agents\r\n\r\n_____________________________________________\r\n\r\nThese particulars are issued by de Courcy Estate Agents on the understanding\r\n that any negotiations relating to the property are conducted through them. \r\nWhile every care is taken in preparing them, de Courcy Estate Agents, \r\nfor themselves and for the vendor/lessor whose agents they are, give notice\r\n that: (1) The particulars are set out as general outline for guiding potential but \r\nmust satisfy themselves (at their own expense) as their correctness. (3) Neither \r\nde Courcy Estate Agents or any of its employees have any authority to make \r\nany or give any representation or warranty in relation to the property."
      },
